# Contact form → CRM integration
#
# Set this to any CRM's inbound webhook URL (GoHighLevel, HubSpot, Zapier, Make,
# n8n, etc.) and every Contact page submission is forwarded there automatically —
# no code changes required. Leave unset and the form falls back to a pre-filled
# mailto: link so no lead is ever lost.
CRM_WEBHOOK_URL=
